  "description": "Test build of four Briar mechanics as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): Chilling Scream stuns only the champions pushed into a wall, the map's edge or a unit (the main pack's stuns everyone it knocks back, since data cannot see walls); in Blood Frenzy and Hemomania she attacks the nearest enemy (her prey in Hemomania) instead of the AI's pick and does not recall; Hemomania lasts while her prey lives (up to 15 s; the main pack's 6 s); Crimson Curse - each ability costs 5% of her current health and her own heals grow by up to 40% with her missing health (the main pack has neither: data cannot read current health). Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-14",
  "mod_id": "league_briar_frenzy",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "name": "League Heroes: Briar's walls, frenzy lock and prey (test)",
  "version": "0.1.4"
}
